   Helen, Youri, DGA, Paris, France.
   Coulon, Jean-Francois; Deroux-Dauphin, Patrice, Temento, St Egreve, France.},
Keywords = {Soft Errors; Radiation; Cross-Layer Reliability Analysis;
   Single/Multiple-Bit Faults; Fabrication Technology},
Affiliations = {Inria; National Office for Aerospace Studies \& Research (ONERA);
