Abstract = {Rapid grows and expansion smart systems application, wide use data
   transmission networks require cryptographic protection of such data.
   Graph model of nonlinear neuro-like data encryption algorithm has been
   developed. This model provides a transition to the structure of hardware
   to process data of different intensity. The structure of the hardware
   for implementation basic operation of nonlinear neuro-like encryption is
   focused on FPGA. The method of implementing multi-input summation has
   been improved, which, due to the complex use of vertical and
   multi-operand approaches, ensured a time reduction of summation of a
   group of operands.},
